#: fprintd-manager:1484
msgid ""
"Fingerprint manager for readers supported by fprintd on Linux.\n"
"\n"
"Adapted from chipsailing-cs9711-fingerprint-linux for the packaged fprintd "
"service. Thank you to Mahmud Farooque and the upstream contributors. The "
"original GUI is MIT licensed. The upstream community libfprint driver is "
"LGPL-2.1-or-later, from the archeYR/libfprint-CS9711 community fork."
msgstr ""
"适用于 Linux 上 fprintd 支持的指纹读取器的指纹管理器。\n"
"\n"
"改编自 chipsailing-cs9711-fingerprint-linux，适配打包的 fprintd 服务。感谢 "
"Mahmud Farooque 及上游贡献者。原始图形界面采用 MIT 许可证。上游社区 "
"libfprint 驱动采用 LGPL-2.1-or-later 许可证，来自 archeYR/libfprint-CS9711 社"
"区分支。"

